{"title":"Career roadmap · Reporting Analyst","role":"Reporting Analyst","summary":"A Reporting Analyst transforms business and operational data into recurring reports, dashboards, KPIs and actionable insights. The role sits between data analysis, business intelligence and reporting operations and is a strong entry-level pathway for a BCA Data Science/Analytics graduate.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"BCA – Data Science / Analytics","Timeline assumption":"3-year BCA beginning in 2026 → graduation around 2029. For a 4-year honours structure, graduation would typically be around 2030."},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Direct"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BCA Data Science/Analytics","Excel + SQL + BI","Reporting Internship","Reporting Analyst","Data/BI Analyst","Senior Analyst","BI/Analytics Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"The most important employability combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","SQL","Power BI/Tableau","data modelling","business understanding","communication"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2029/30"},{"text":"Master Excel, SQL, statistics, Power BI/Tableau and reporting automation."}],[{"text":"2029–2034"},{"text":"Move from report production into analytical problem-solving and business intelligence."}],[{"text":"2034–2040"},{"text":"Become a Senior BI/Data Analyst, Analytics Consultant or BI Developer/Lead."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress toward Analytics Manager, BI Architect, Head of Analytics or specialised data leadership."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Excel + statistics"},{"text":"