esearch analytics"}],[{"text":"IITs/IISc"},{"text":"Data research and analytics"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Private employers"},{"type":"p","text":"Monitor analytics/reporting opportunities at:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/"},{"text":"Amazon","url":"https://www.amazon.com/"},{"text":"Google","url":"https://www.google.com/"},{"text":"IBM","url":"https://www.ibm.com/"},{"text":"TCS","url":"https://www.tcs.com/"},{"text":"Infosys","url":"https://www.infosys.com/"},{"text":"Accenture","url":"https://www.accenture.com/"},{"text":"Deloitte","url":"https://www.deloitte.com/"},{"text":"PwC","url":"https://www.pwc.com/"},{"text":"EY","url":"https://www.ey.com/"},{"text":"Banks and financial institutions"},{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Healthcare analytics companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also build a portfolio on GitHub.","url":"https://github.com/"},{"type":"note","label":"Best internship evidence","text":"Deliver a real dashboard or reporting workflow used by a team, with documented KPI definitions, data validation and stakeholder feedback."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification/course","Cost","When","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"Microsoft Power BI Data Analyst / PL-300"},{"text":"Paid exam; current fee: check the official site"},{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Strong BI credential"}],[{"text":"SQL certification/course"},{"text":"Free/paid"},{"text":"Year 1–2"},{"text":"Database competency"}],[{"text":"Excel advanced certification/course"},{"text":"Free/paid"},{"text":"Year 1–2"},{"text":"Reporting foundation"}],[{"text":"Tableau training/certification"},{"text":"Paid;"},{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Alternative BI ecosystem"}],[{"text":"Python data analytics"},{"text":"Free/paid"},{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Advanced analysis"}],[{"text":"Google Data Analytics"},{"text":"Paid subscri