ness Analytics"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data Visualisation"},{"text":"Decision Science"},{"text":"Operations Research"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Machine Learning"},{"text":"Information Systems"},{"text":"Business Intelligence"},{"text":"Data Engineering"},{"text":"Econometrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"The long-term goal should be to move beyond “preparing reports” into owning business metrics and analytical systems. Senior professionals should understand semantic modelling, data governance, cloud warehouses, analytics engineering, experimentation and AI-assisted decision-making. This creates a path from Reporting Analyst to Analytics Lead, BI Architect, Analytics Manager or Head of Analytics."}]}]}